# Riverpod — Jangan Extract Provider ke Variabel

Jangan pernah membuat variabel yang isinya `ref.watch` / `ref.read` (atau hasil method notifier dari situ).

Pakai langsung di tempat yang butuh.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
final currentIndex = ref.watch(onboardingProvider);
final notifier = ref.read(onboardingProvider.notifier);
final path = await ref.read(splashProvider.notifier).initialize();
final api = ref.watch(apiServiceProvider);

OnboardingDotIndicator(currentIndex: currentIndex);
context.go(path);
return api.fetchAcademicSemesters(mock: mockStatus);

// ✅ GOOD
OnboardingDotIndicator(currentIndex: ref.watch(onboardingProvider));
context.go(await ref.read(splashProvider.notifier).initialize());
PrimaryButton(
  onPressed: () =>
      ref.read(onboardingProvider.notifier).goToNextPage(controller),
);
return ref
    .watch(apiServiceProvider)
    .fetchAcademicSemesterSummary(mock: mockStatus);
return ref.watch(apiServiceProvider).fetchAcademicAdvisorApproval(
  semesterIndex: ref.watch(academicTabSemesterProvider),
  mock: mockStatus,
);
```

Yang boleh jadi variabel: controller, form key, animation, dsb — **bukan** hasil `ref.watch` / `ref.read`.

# Widget — Satu Custom Widget = Satu File

Ikuti pola `home_page.dart`: **page cuma compose widget**, nggak nulis UI custom di dalam file page.

## Page file

- Isi page: `ref.watch` / `ref.listenFuture`, layout utama, dan **import widget dari file lain**
- Jangan bikin class widget baru (private maupun public) di file page
- Jangan bikin `_WidgetXXX`, `_HeaderSection`, `_buildSomething()` yang return widget kompleks

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — home_page.dart
class HomePage extends ConsumerWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {
    return CustomScrollScaffold(
      child: Column(
        children: [
          ref.watch(homeSummaryProvider).when(
            loading: () => const HomeHeaderShimmer(),
            error: (_, _) => HomeHeaderError(
              onRetry: () => ref.invalidate(homeSummaryProvider),
            ),
            data: (summary) => HomeHeader(
              name: summary.name.toString(),
              onNotificationTap: () => context.push(AppPaths.notification),
            ),
          ),
          HomeMenuAccess(onClassScheduleTap: () { ... }),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

## Widget file

- Setiap widget custom **wajib file sendiri** di folder `widgets/` feature
- Class **public** (PascalCase), bukan private (`_Something`)
- Satu file = satu widget utama (shimmer/error/content dipisah kalau perlu)

Contoh struktur home:

```
features/home/
├── pages/home_page.dart
└── widgets/
    ├── home_header.dart
    ├── home_header_shimmer.dart
    ├── home_header_error.dart
    ├── home_schedule_card.dart
    ├── home_schedule_card_shimmer.dart
    └── home_schedule_card_error.dart
```

## Penamaan file & class

- File: `snake_case.dart` (contoh: `home_header_shimmer.dart`)
- Class: PascalCase, prefix feature (contoh: `HomeHeaderShimmer`, `HomeScheduleCardError`)
- Shimmer / error / empty / builder → **file terpisah**, jangan digabung di page

## Builder & Item — Penamaan List Widget

Kalau UI-nya **list/array**, pisah jadi 2 peran:

| Peran       | Penamaan                                                   | Tugas                                      |
| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| **Builder** | `{feature}_{nama}_builder.dart` → `{Feature}{Nama}Builder` | Loop data, compose list, spacing/separator |
| **Item**    | `{feature}_{nama}_item.dart` → `{Feature}{Nama}Item`       | Satu baris/card/chip di dalam list         |

### Builder

- Dipakai di page/section lewat `.when(data: ...)`
- Isinya `ListView` / `Column` + `List.generate` / `for`
- **Nggak** nulis UI detail item di dalam builder — panggil widget Item

```dart
// ✅ GOOD — class_schedule_builder.dart
class ClassScheduleBuilder extends StatelessWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Column(
      children: List.generate(items.length, (index) {
        return ClassScheduleCardItem(
          name: items[index].name.toString(),
          ...
        );
      }),
    );
  }
}
```

Shimmer builder → `{nama}_builder_shimmer.dart` / `{Nama}BuilderShimmer`

### Item

- Widget **satu elemen** dalam list (card, row, chip, tile)
- **Wajib** suffix `_item` di file & class
- Builder yang render list **harus** import Item, bukan Card/Row tanpa suffix

```dart
// ❌ BAD — class_schedule_card.dart (seharusnya item)
class ClassScheduleCard extends StatelessWidget { ... }

// ✅ GOOD — class_schedule_card_item.dart
class ClassScheduleCardItem extends StatelessWidget { ... }

// ✅ GOOD — contoh lain di project
// academic_course_builder.dart  → AcademicCourseBuilder
// academic_course_item.dart     → AcademicCourseItem
// helpdesk_ticket_builder.dart  → HelpdeskTicketBuilder
// helpdesk_ticket_item.dart     → HelpdeskTicketItem
// home_news_item.dart           → HomeNewsItem
```

### Struktur folder contoh class schedule

```
features/class_schedule/widgets/
├── class_schedule_builder.dart
├── class_schedule_builder_shimmer.dart
├── class_schedule_card_item.dart      ← bukan class_schedule_card.dart
├── class_schedule_day_selector.dart
└── class_schedule_empty.dart
```

### Card vs Item

- Kalau widget itu **cuma 1 elemen list** → pakai suffix **Item** (`ClassScheduleCardItem`, `FaqItemCard` boleh kalau memang card-style item)
- Kalau widget itu **section/card standalone** (bukan elemen list) → boleh tanpa Item (`HomeScheduleCard`, `AcademicSemesterSummaryCard`)

```dart
// ❌ BAD — home_page.dart
class HomePage extends ConsumerWidget { ... }

class _HomeHeaderSection extends StatelessWidget { ... }

Widget _buildScheduleCard() { ... }

// ❌ BAD — home_summary_card.dart
class HomeSummaryCard extends ConsumerWidget { ... }

class _AcademicContent extends StatelessWidget { ... }

class _GpaItem extends StatelessWidget { ... }

// ✅ GOOD
// home_page.dart          → HomePage (compose only)
// home_header.dart        → HomeHeader
// home_academic_content.dart → HomeAcademicContent
// home_gpa_item.dart      → HomeGpaItem
```

## Yang boleh inline di page

- Widget bawaan Flutter (`Column`, `SizedBox`, `Padding`, dll)
- Widget shared global (`CustomScrollScaffold`, `PrimaryButton`, dll)
- Callback sederhana (`onTap: () => context.push(...)`)

## Yang nggak boleh inline / nested di page

- Widget UI custom baru (header, card, list item, section, dll)
- Private widget class (`_Xxx`)
- Helper method yang return widget kompleks (`Widget _buildXxx()`)

Kalau UI mulai panjang atau reusable → **pindah ke file widget baru**.

# Model — Penamaan File & Class

- File: `snake_case_model.dart` (contoh: `user_model.dart`, `faq_item_model.dart`)
- Class: PascalCase + suffix `Model` (contoh: `UserModel`, `FaqItemModel`)
- Enum/status tetap tanpa suffix `Model` kalau memang enum (contoh: `HelpdeskTicketStatus`)

# Model — Field Nullable

Field model API harus nullable. Jangan `required` + default palsu (`''`, `0`) di `fromJson`. Fallback tampilan di UI (`?? ''`), bukan di model.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
const UserModel({required this.name});
final String name;

factory UserModel.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {
  return UserModel(name: (json['name'] ?? '') as String);
}

// ✅ GOOD
const UserModel({this.name});
final String? name;

factory UserModel.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {
  return UserModel(name: json['name']?.toString());
}

Text(user.name ?? '');
```

# Model — fromJson Ikut Response BE

Jangan fallback ke nama field lain di `fromJson`. Tulis key persis seperti response BE.

```dart
// ❌ BAD — BE kirim "name", jangan mapping sendiri
factory UserModel.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {
  return UserModel(name: (json['name'] ?? json['nama'])?.toString());
}

// ✅ GOOD
factory UserModel.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json) {
  return UserModel(name: json['name']?.toString());
}
```

Kalau BE belum sesuai, fix di BE — bukan di mobile dengan alias field.
